<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov zinc output up 0.29 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov zinc output up 0.29 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's zinc output totalled 973,800 tonnes in the first 11 months of 1996, up 0.29 percent compared with the same period last year, the State Statistical Bureau said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Zinc production in November alone was 102,300 tonnes, the bureau said without giving a comparison.</p>
</text>
